{"ID":"20240513083413-eqixget","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083413-eqixget","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083413-eqixget\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105133-ratphyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105133-ratphyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105133-ratphyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:323,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:323\u0026#125;","title":"043","type":"doc","updated":"20240514095710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105133-ratphyn","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 838px;","id":"20240513105133-ratphyn","updated":"20240514095710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 027-2 D, B"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4/22/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經困難"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"停服安眠藥後 初起無法睡 後來漸漸可以睡，一旦入眠可睡二小時。但仍無法很快入眠。晨起睡醒時比以前有精神。體力好轉，身熱仍有，但減少中。盜汗改善，雙足仍冷但好轉中。胃口下降中。大便可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈浮弦，但無中空現象。(無勞脈)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步中，神仍不易入心。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 黃芩三錢 龍膽草三錢 當歸二錢 遠志五錢 龍骨五錢 牡蠣八錢 茯神三錢 補骨脂三錢 澤瀉五錢 炮附子三錢 黃連二錢 白芍五錢 烏藥五錢 細辛二錢 阿膠三錢(分三包) 加半夏三錢 南星三錢 梔子三錢。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肆付。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能入睡乃神不能入心，病患服前方後一切都好轉僅睡眠未改善 必有痰飲。久病憂鬱易有痰飲。故加半夏南星去痰，梔子清虛熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}